the servo motors rotate, the center of gravity changes and the
balloon and microblowers rotate. Take rising for example. Changing
the center of gravity viewed from the microblower can drive the
great circle horizontal with the microblowers facing downwards
as shown in Figure 4 (b). The drone can also rotate in the
yaw axis direction by driving only the microblowers on one side.
